    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνᾱλίζω</span></b>  (A), aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνήλισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.176
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άλισα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				125
			</span></i>:—<i>bring together, collect, assemble</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.125
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐς τὴν ἀκρόπολιν τὰς
				γυναῖκας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				176
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.111
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐπιεικεστάτους . . πρὸς τὴν
					σκηνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					1.1.30
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>come together, assemble</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.15
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				102
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.3.48
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἰς τοὺς τελείους ἄνδρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.2.15
				</span></i>
			; of things, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πλεῖστον ἐκ τοῦ
				μυελοῦ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Oss.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βορβόρου περὶ αὐτὰ συναλισθέντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					763a33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
